{"Test cleanup uses testRealm().identityProviders().get(\"alias\")::remove while created IDPs use \"idp-alias-*\" pattern - this will not remove the created IDPs and could cause test pollution/flakiness": 0.8810856938362122, "remove(String alias) method fetches storedIdp via idpDelegate.getByAlias(alias) and unconditionally uses it for invalidations - if the alias does not exist, this may lead to null being passed into invalidation logic and potentially trigger a null dereference via predicate evaluation": 0.7202203273773193, "The login cache stores results in IdentityProviderListQuery keyed by searchKey (organization id or empty string) - for realms with many organizations, this can accumulate many per-org entries under a single cacheKeyForLogin(realm, mode) and may grow without bounds unless there is eviction/TTL elsewhere": 0.41535821557044983}